  "$schema": "meridian/template-eligibility/1",
  "authored": true,
  "note": "Hand-authored judgment, machine-checked. Eligibility is a design decision per screen and cannot be generated; scripts/check_template_eligibility.py validates completeness, reason codes and the reference scan, and regenerates the adoption block in docs/METRICS.md. A template carrying `retained` is an unpublished compatibility screen: check_design_system_governance.py reports its entry-contract gaps as warnings and fails if it appears in the manifest's template list.",
